ails with a <br>\r\nfull code listing on Stack Overflow:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n<a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/76705890/possible-bias-when-fitting-linear-regression-with-errors-in-variables-using-tmb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stackoverflow.com/questions/76705890/possible-bias-when-fitting-linear-regression-with-errors-in-variables-using-tmb&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792461701623000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pFhzUO0rGO_CRXAbZBfPw\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/76705890/possible-bias-when-fitting-linear-regression-with-errors-in-variables-using-tmb</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nsince my attempt to post it all here was rejected by the server. Any <br>\r\nsuggestions would be appreciated. Thank you for taking thetime to consider <br>\r\nmy problem.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nRegards, Darren<br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-407682496392552181_m_6890168605436669774_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);padding:5px 20px\">\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(99,99,99);font-size:11px\">\r\n      \r\n      You received this digest because you&#39;re subscribed to updates for this group. You can change your settings on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/tmb-users/join\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/tmb-users/join&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792461701623000&amp;usg=AOv